					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 60080101,
					"content": "Let's see now... What's changed since we were gone?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080102,
					"content": "Not as much as I'd imagined.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080103,
					"content": "Yeah. If anything, looks like things are settling down. That's Lauma for ya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080104,
					"content": "Hey there, Lauma. We're back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080105,
					"content": "How have things been these past few days?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080106,
					"content": "The clean up work has been much more complicated than I expected. Solving problems that have built up over time is a tall order, to say the least...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080107,
					"content": "I believe it will take a few weeks more. Fortunately, those who remained appear to have shaken off the initial confusion and are becoming more proactive by the day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080108,
					"content": "It's as if they've finally been forced to come face-to-face with what their faith actually is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080109,
					"content": "And it's all thanks to you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080110,
					"content": "No, I... I should have done this a lot sooner.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080111,
					"content": "I've been focused on taking care of myself these past few days, so I'm in a good place. And since you're looking after the Moon Marrow for us, I should be able to help you investigate the truth of the past.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080112,
					"content": "Thanks for remembering.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080113,
					"content": "Speaking of which, have you heard anything new about that phantom?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080114,
					"content": "I've tried asking around, but to no avail.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080115,
					"content": "What about you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080116,
					"content": "We haven't made much progress either, but here's what we've got...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080117,
					"content": "I think I've got the gist of it... Sounds like you've got your work cut out for you too. Don't forget to take good care of yourselves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080118,
					"content": "#In any case, come this way, {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080119,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080120,
					"content": "What do you see?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080121,
					"content": "(This is... Nod-Krai? This all looks familiar...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080122,
					"content": "(Is that... a shooting star in the sky?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080123,
					"content": "(No, wait! That's our spaceship!)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080124,
					"content": "Is it over already?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080125,
					"content": "This appears to have occurred a long, long time ago. The memories I sensed are highly turbulent and disordered, so that is all my power allows me to discern.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080126,
					"content": "(At least we now know where our spaceship landed in Nod-Krai... Near Starsand Shoal, or so it seems.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080127,
					"content": "#(That matches with what {M#Lumine}{F#Aether} told me... But I want to know more...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080128,
					"content": "!!!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Luonnotar"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080129,
					"content": "Huh? What's the matter?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080130,
					"content": "The flowers changed color...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080131,
					"content": "(These flowers are a reflection of The Damselette's powers. Does that mean she's...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080132
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080132,
					"content": "(I remember her mentioning that she wanted to use the Moon Marrow to restore some of her power...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080133,
					"content": "Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60080134,
					"content": "Yeah, we should go see her, and see if we can help her in some way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080135,
					"content": "I'll leave that in your hands, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080136,
					"content": "Oh, wait — here you go! This is the medicine you asked the Curatorium of Secrets to help prepare earlier.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080137,
					"content": "Ah. Thanks for coming all this way with it. You've been a huge help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080138,
					"content": "Also... If I may, I have a feeling that \"Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar\" might be able to help you get a more detailed glimpse at the memories about your spaceship.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lauma"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080139,
					"content": "Ooh, that's true. She's the Kuutar, after all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080140,
					"content": "But we'd best check if she's doing okay first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60080141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 60080141,
					"content": "Seeya later, then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
